      "Write endpoints are deliberately excluded: this spec is read-only GET only. Meilisearch documents both POST and GET search; the GET form is used so the tool stays semantically and mechanically read-only."
    ]
  },
  "rateLimit": {
    "windowMs": 60000,
    "max": 30
  }
}
